    "sections": {
        "description": "Bring the charm of your café online with the Coffee Shop Bistro theme, a beautifully designed and feature-rich solution tailored for coffee shops, cappuccino shops, specialty coffee stores, coffee roasteries, cafés, bistros, bakeries, breakfast spots, and restaurants. This elegant theme captures the warmth and ambiance of a real coffeehouse, helping you create an inviting online space for coffee lovers and food enthusiasts. The Coffee Shop Bistro theme offers a fully responsive layout that looks stunning on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices, along with easy customization options to adjust colors, fonts, and layouts to match your café branding. Ideal for showcasing menus, coffee products, desserts, beverages, and daily specials, it also supports online reservations, table booking, and ordering systems. Built with SEO-friendly structure and fast-loading performance, it helps improve search visibility for local cafés and bistro businesses. You can promote offers, share your story, integrate social media, support translations, and use WooCommerce to sell coffee beans, merchandise, or gift items online. Whether you run a cozy neighborhood coffee shop, a modern café, or a stylish bistro, this theme delivers a professional web presence with smooth navigation, interactive menus, and visually appealing sections designed to convert visitors into customers. Demo Link - https://pattern.cretathemes.com/coffee-shop-bistro/"
    },
